<div class="architecture-section">
  <p class="eyebrow">The Curator Architecture</p>
  <h2 class="architecture-title">One Integrated Stack</h2>
  <p class="architecture-intro">We are not building another generic software wrapper renting cloud intelligence. Curator is an on-premise infrastructure stack owned entirely by the institution:</p>

  <div class="architecture-stack">
    <div class="stack-item">
      <span class="stack-name">Cadenza Studio</span>
      <span class="stack-role">First Application</span>
      <span class="stack-desc">An AI-native, open-source, offline operating system for private tutors and small studios.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="stack-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="stack-item">
      <span class="stack-name">Curator Engine</span>
      <span class="stack-role">The Intelligence Engine</span>
      <span class="stack-desc">Local inference and private Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) managing local agents, permissions, and data within vertical SaaS solutions.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="stack-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="stack-item">
      <span class="stack-name">Curator Node</span>
      <span class="stack-role">The Hardware Appliance</span>
      <span class="stack-desc">Headless, plug-and-play physical server that non-technical clients can purchase and run locally.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ownership-grid">
    <div class="ownership-item">
      <span class="ownership-label">Host</span>
      <span class="ownership-desc">Run the engine on hardware you own, from a personal laptop to a dedicated Curator Node.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ownership-item">
      <span class="ownership-label">Store</span>
      <span class="ownership-desc">Keep lesson records, student files, and community archives in a private library only you can reach.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ownership-item">
      <span class="ownership-label">Share</span>
      <span class="ownership-desc">Open what you choose, to whom you choose, over encrypted private tunnels and permissioned APIs.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ownership-item">
      <span class="ownership-label">Own</span>
      <span class="ownership-desc">Your knowledge, your computer, your terms. Forever. Our SaaS solutions offer individuals independence from centralized cloud servers and other privately owned tech solutions.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .architecture-section {
    padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .architecture-title {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  .architecture-intro {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-3xl);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  .architecture-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }
  .stack-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-2xl);
    background: #fff;
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    min-width: 300px;
    max-width: 500px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .stack-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
  .stack-role {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--accent-orange);
  }
  .stack-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    max-width: 360px;
  }
  .stack-connector {
    width: 2px;
    height: 20px;
    background: var(--border);
  }
  .ownership-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .ownership-item {
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .ownership-label {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--accent-orange);
  }
  .ownership-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ownership-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ownership-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
